# Lines no commit message of this repository carries: trailers and notes
# that attribute a commit to a tool, an assistant, a session or a co-author.
# One extended regular expression per line, matched with grep -i -E in the
# C locale (bytes: a non-ASCII hyphen, a zero-width space or an emoji is a
# run of non-alphanumeric bytes) against every line of a commit's raw
# message. The commit check refuses a pattern grep cannot use and a line
# with a carriage return.
#
# The patterns are broad on purpose. These are refused too, so describe
# them in other words in a commit message:
# - a line whose first words end in "by:", "session:", "author:" or
#   "authors:" ("Caused by:", "Per-session:", an "X-...-Session:" header);
# - a line that starts with an authoring verb followed by with, by, using
#   or via ("Generated by make generate");
# - "this (or the) commit, change or patch was (or has been) generated,
#   written, authored, assisted or produced";
# - "AI-generated", "AI-assisted" and the like;
# - ChatGPT, Copilot or Codex up to three words after an authoring verb and
#   with, by, using or via;
# - the word "claude" (not as part of a path or a file name), the word
#   "anthropic", and the domains claude.ai and claude.com;
# - a line that starts with "aider:".
#
co[^[:alnum:]]{0,8}authored[^[:alnum:]]{0,8}by
^[^[:alnum:]]*([[:alnum:]]+[^[:alnum:]:]{1,8}){0,3}(by|session|authors?)[[:space:]]*:
^[^[:alnum:]]*(generated|created|made|written|assisted|authored|produced|built|developed|implemented|pair[^[:alnum:]]{0,8}programmed)[^[:alnum:]]+(with|by|using|via|w/)([^[:alnum:]_]|$)
(this|the)[^[:alnum:]]+(commit|change|patch)[^[:alnum:]]+(was|has[^[:alnum:]]+been)[^[:alnum:]]+(generated|written|authored|assisted|produced)
(^|[^[:alnum:]])ai[^[:alnum:]]{0,8}(generated|assisted|authored|written)
(^|[^[:alnum:]])(generated|created|made|written|assisted|authored|produced|implemented|programmed)[^[:alnum:]]+(with|by|using|via)[^[:alnum:]]+([[:alnum:]-]+[^[:alnum:]]+){0,3}(chatgpt|copilot|codex)([^[:alnum:]]|$)
^[^[:alnum:]]*aider[[:space:]]*:
(^|[^[:alnum:]./])claude([^[:alnum:]/.]|\.([^[:alnum:]]|$)|$)
anthropic
claude\.(ai|com)
